        "answer": {
          "short": "$9$",
          "worked": "Set $x=0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2y-18&=0\\\\2y&=18\\\\y&=9\\end{align*}$$\nThe $y$-intercept is $9$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
